        ['q' => 'Are burst pipes from a freeze covered?', 'a' => '<p>Sudden and accidental water damage from a burst pipe is often covered under a homeowners policy, subject to its terms and exclusions. Some policies limit coverage if the home was vacant or not reasonably heated. Winter Storm Uri in February 2021 caused widespread burst pipes in Hays County. See <a href="/services/freeze-damage-claims/">freeze damage claims</a>.</p>'],
